<% @title = "You're invited to #{@event_name}" %>

<div class="pill">Fresh invite</div>
<h2><%= @user.full_name %>, you’re on the list.</h2>

<div class="panel">
  <p style="margin: 0 0 6px;"><strong><%= @event_name %></strong></p>
  <p style="margin: 0 0 6px;">Date & time: <%= @event_date %></p>
  <p style="margin: 0;">HQ: <a href="<%= @event_url %>">View location</a></p>
</div>

<p>Tap the details, sync your RSVP, and get the conversation humming before doors open.</p>

<a href="<%= @event_url %>" class="cta">Enter event hub</a>

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">Need to invite more friends? Ping the host inside the event.</p>
